<title>FINLAND: Huhtamaki 96 net sales, profits by division.</title>
<headline>Huhtamaki 96 net sales, profits by division.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish confectionery, packaging materials and pharmaceuticals group Huhtamaki Oy on Tuesday gave the following breakdown of its 1996 net sales and operating profit (million markka):</p>
<p>NET SALES:</p>
<p>Jan-Dec 1996		  Jan-Dec 1995</p>
<p> Leaf			   4,289			  4,307</p>
<p> Polarcup		     2,551			  2,484</p>
<p>OPERATING PROFIT</p>
<p> Leaf			     227			    252</p>
<p> Polarcup			 214			    161</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358 - 9 - 6805 0248</p>
</text>
